@neurodesk/brainchop wraps the pinned @brainchop/core (v1.0.0, MIT License,
https://github.com/neuroneural/brainchop-core) threaded CPU WebAssembly modules
for whole-brain T1-weighted MRI segmentation and tissue fraction mapping.

Bundled models in @brainchop/core:
- MindMap-24 (mindmap): 18-class cortical and subcortical segmentation and GM/WM/CSF tissue fractions
- MindMap-16 (mindmap-fast): lightweight 18-class segmentation
- MindSnap-104 (mindsnap): 104-region Desikan-Killiany cortical, subcortical and corpus callosum atlas

See @brainchop/core's THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md (included under licenses/npm in
portable releases) for full upstream attributions.

